  "priorExpiration": "2007-12-06",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WC 203.01 Appealing a Decision to the Council. Any person wishing to appeal a department decision allowed by law to be appealed to the council shall file a notice of appeal as specified in Env-WC 203.02 within 30 days of the date the decision being appealed was issued, as evidenced by the date on the decision.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading Env-WC 200) #5469, eff 9-17-92, EXPIRED: 9-17-98\n\nNew. #6860, INTERIM, eff 10-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-29-99\n\nNew. #7011, eff 6-9-99; ss by #8892, INTERIM, eff 6-9-07, EXPIRES: 12-6-07; ss by #8977-A, eff 9-14-07",
